==Notes==
*In Incarnon form, the Dex and Prime variants have very similar stats and, after commonly used Evolutions, primarily differ as follows:
**{{Weapon|Dex Sybaris}} with '''Elemental Dominance''': 111 Damage, 50% Status Chance, better recoil
**{{Weapon|Sybaris Prime}} with '''Survivor's Edge''': &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;125 Damage, 40% Status Chance, better accuracy

==Known Bugs==
*'''Elemental Dominance''' gives '''Sybaris Prime''' a bonus of '''+(8% + 15%) = +23%''' Status Chance in Incarnon form, rather than the expected '''+(8% * 2) = +16%'''.

